        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Twisted Gallery — where reality distorts in silence.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself alone in a modern art museum. White walls, black floors, and meticulously arranged exhibits. Everything seems orderly… yet deeply unsettling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is simple: <u>observe and make the right decisions.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Sometimes, moving deeper into discomfort may reveal something different.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you spot the changes? Or will you remain forever trapped in the familiar?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological horror game inspired by <i>The Exit 8</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive first-person exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies do not repeat until all have been encountered</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden Easter egg anomalies waiting to be discovered</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autosave system with the ability to pause at any time</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Streaming &amp; Video Guidelines</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're free to livestream or upload videos of the game as long as you mention the game's title and platform in your content or description — no need to contact the developer.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If possible, we’d greatly appreciate it if you also include a link to this Steam store page in your content. Thank you so much!</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Twisted Gallery — where reality distorts in silence.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself alone in a modern art museum. White walls, black floors, and meticulously arranged exhibits. Everything seems orderly… yet deeply unsettling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is simple: <u>observe and make the right decisions.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Sometimes, moving deeper into discomfort may reveal something different.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you spot the changes? Or will you remain forever trapped in the familiar?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological horror game inspired by <i>The Exit 8</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive first-person exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies do not repeat until all have been encountered</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden Easter egg anomalies waiting to be discovered</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autosave system with the ability to pause at any time</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Streaming &amp; Video Guidelines</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're free to livestream or upload videos of the game as long as you mention the game's title and platform in your content or description — no need to contact the developer.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If possible, we’d greatly appreciate it if you also include a link to this Steam store page in your content. Thank you so much!</p></li></ul>",
